    Gestures:</b></color>\n\u2022 <color=#66E6FF>Rapier</color> - Thrust forward
    to fire a projectile (60 dmg)\n\u2022 <color=#FFF033>Split</color> - Chop downward
    for cone damage (45 dmg)\n\u2022 <color=#4DB8FF>Block</color> - Both hands up
    to become invulnerable\n\u2022 <color=#FF6666>Konan SY</color> - Both hands above
    head for fireball barrage\n\n<color=#00FF88><b>Economy:</b></color>\n\u2022 Defeat
    monsters to earn coins\n\u2022 Buy weapons and potions at the shop\n\u2022 Collect
    1000 coins to buy a Final Boss ticket\n\n<color=#FF6666><b>Weapons:</b></color>\n\u2022
    Weapons unlock in order (cheapest first)\n\u2022 Each weapon has damage and durability
    stats\n\u2022 Broken weapons must be re-spawned from the shop\n\n<color=#FFD700><b>Goal:</b></color>\nDefeat
    the Final Boss to win the game!\nGood luck, warrior!"
